+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items for duplicate references and arithmetic mismatches and returns findings for a human finance operator.
+
+## Users and boundaries
+
+- The findings are for a human finance operator.
+- The service never authorizes or sends a payment.
+
+## Current implementation evidence
+
+`/src/invoice-review.ts` defines invoice lines by reference and amount in cents and implements deterministic detection of duplicate references. It returns sorted unique duplicate references.
+
+The README states that the project also reviews arithmetic mismatches, but the current source does not establish how arithmetic mismatches are detected or returned. No broader runtime behavior is established by the repository.
